{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/826488-non-player-cards-seem-like-an-awesome-thing-to-me","id":826488,"title":"Non Player Cards seem like an awesome thing to me","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-02-08T19:46:43-08:00","id":826488,"title":"Non Player Cards seem like an awesome thing to me","content":"I feel like in writing this it's going to come off as Spammy but how do you share a new product you found, where it might do some good do some good. Disclaimer: I'm not affiliated with the product or it's team in anyway, I just think it's cool.<br /> <br /> I have problems making Characters as a GM. It's the most tedious thing to me, at the same time I can't play premade characters without enough story for me to feel out their personality. I could probably portray the characters of Lullay, Lullay, but not many of the ones in the backs of the books. So don't want to make characters, I can't portray premades, and on top of that I'm really bad at improving them. Enter Non Player Cards <a href=\"http://drivethrurpg.com/product/171419/NonPlayer-Cards-PrintPDF-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">http://drivethrurpg.com/product/1714...rintPDF-BUNDLE</a> which were a <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/metalweavedesigns/non-player-cards-npc-a-card-based-npc-generator/\" target=\"_blank\">kickstarter</a>, basically you can draw cards from the decks to inspire you, then fill out the details yourself.<br /> <br /> Currently playing with them to give more dimensions to the characters I've already created for my chronicle. <br /> <br /> Example, I have a Girl who suffered the loss of a friend, and turns to heroine, is later offered a chance to &quot;save herself&quot; by a demon. Nice concept but lacks some body. Here's the cards I drew (unshuffled decks): Atonement, Analyst, Abuser, Adorned, Acrobat, Always Drinking, Apprentice.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"color:#232323\"><span style=\"font-family:Open Sans\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">In middle school and highschool she was a gymnast, well adjusted young girl. Everything was fine, until her friend, Saundra Braunston is killed tragically.<br /> After the death of her friend she began drinking, and eventually heroin, when she wasn\u2019t stoned out of her mind she became violent, the slightest thing would set her off.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#232323\"><span style=\"font-family:Open Sans\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">She wears large hoop earrings, bracelet\u2019s and necklaces when she goes out. They aren\u2019t gold but she still rocks the bling.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#232323\"><span style=\"font-family:Open Sans\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Jezebel was a highschool dropout heroin addict until she made a deal with the devil, now \u201cher life\u201d is better, but it\u2019s not her life anymore is it. An analyst took her, figured it could make her have a full recovery. Figures if her recovery helps her family and maybe some of her friends, then she\u2019s helped restore things just a little bit from the work she did for the machine. Always watching never acting.</span></span></span></span></span></span> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#232323\"><span style=\"font-family:Open Sans\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><br /> <br /> p.s. this isn't supposed to be an example of great or publishable writing.<br /> <br /> Anyways, maybe someone else'll like the cards. Feel free to share any NPC creating tips you have too, someone else might find them useful.</span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}